        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">Starting at ¥19.9/mo. CN2/BGP for China traffic.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold">¥50-200<span class="text-gray-600 text-xs font-normal">/sale</span></div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">30 days cookie</div>
        </div>
      </a>

